<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-United Energy mandates ANZ, NAB for programme.</title>
<headline>RTRS-United Energy mandates ANZ, NAB for programme.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Energy said it had mandated the ANZ Banking Group and National Australia Bank Limited to jointly arrange a previously announced A$500 million domestic commercial paper and medium term note programme.</p>
</text>
